<title>USA: EMERGENCY WEATHER CONDITIONS -  WSC - 15-NOV.</title>
<headline>EMERGENCY WEATHER CONDITIONS -  WSC - 15-NOV.</headline>
<text>
<p>Tropical Storm Ernie, with 40 mph winds, is in the South China Sea, nearing Vietnam. Landfall is expected in about 24 hours, after which the storm will move inland and dissipate. Heavy rain along the path of the storm will likely lead to local flooding.</p>
</text>
